/// Alex's pay from Acme's side: the gross comes out of `payroll`, the withholding goes where the household's copy has it, and
/// what is left is Alex's. `employer acme` stands at `payroll`, so the kind's leg is Acme's own half of the payroll tax.
contract alex-pay : employment with alex
  employee alex
  employer acme
  5_750 USD twice monthly on 15, last from payroll #wages
  from 2026-01-01
  irs 692 USD #federal-tax
  ftb 285 USD #state-tax
  ssa 388.56 USD #payroll-tax
  edd 60.95 USD #state-disability

contract alex-bonus : employment with alex
  employee alex
  employer acme
  12_000 USD yearly on 03-14 from payroll #wages
  from 2026-03-14
  irs 2_640 USD #federal-tax
  ftb 1_227.60 USD #state-tax
  ssa 918 USD #payroll-tax
  edd 144 USD #state-disability
